#: pathCheck/options/relations.description
msgid ""
"Add one relationship for each path in the model. In each row, the first "
"variable is the predictor and the second is the dependent variable "
"(predictor → dependent). A dependent variable with several predictors is "
"specified with several rows sharing the same second variable."
msgstr ""
"Agregue una relación por cada ruta del modelo. En cada fila, la primera "
"variable es el predictor y la segunda es la variable dependiente (predictor "
"→ dependiente). Una variable dependiente con varios predictores se "
"especifica con varias filas que comparten la misma segunda variable."

