"to label the plots' horizontal axis. It is not required: if none is "
"selected, Time Series assumes regularly spaced observations following row "
"order and the declared periodicity, and labels the axis with the observation "
"index (1, 2, 3, ...). This variable is not used to check for gaps or "
"irregularities in the time spacing."
